  description: "Lithium (from Greek:\u03BB\u03AF\u03B8\u03BF\u03C2 lithos, \"stone\")
    is a chemical element with the symbol Li and atomic number 3. It is a soft, silver-white
    metal belonging to the alkali metal group of chemical elements. Under standard
    conditions it is the lightest metal and the least dense solid element."
